# Malachor V, the Trayus Core to the end credits (TSL, 904MAL): Kreia as
# Darth Traya at the heart of the Core (CompAtt: k_compatt walks the player
# to wp_kreia_player, 904Kreia; 904MAL_Kreia_Battle 0, start 3: asked
# everything (Atris, why she did this, how she used the Exile, why him,
# what happens now), the offer to save her, refused, Malachor's mass shadow
# generator held over her, "Then let us end this."), fought to half her health
# (k_kreia_userdef: start 2, 904MAL_Kreia_Battle 1 to 2: a hand lost; the
# light side's "I will not strike a defenseless opponent"), the three
# floating lightsabers (LightsaberFloat) and Traya fought until she falls
# (start 1: 2 to 3), her last words: there is still time to save her, the
# future she sees for the galaxy (the Republic, Dantooine, Nar Shaddaa,
# Onderon, Korriban), "Rest now", her death (E108, R110 for the light side),
# the light ending (E109 a_playgoodmovie: MalMov11a, MalMov11b, MalMov12),
# and the game's end (R112 a_end_game: GBL_GAME_COMPLETE, UnlockAllSongs,
# EndGame(FALSE)).
# Starts from the Academy's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @malachor_core data/routes/tsl/malachor_core.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "The End Game" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/);
# GameBanshee 64; Kerbow [WMALTT], [CREDIT].
# Left: the corpses by the side bridges. Each friend's future is the one
# its own globals and influence give (c_npc_evil, c_global_gt).
#
# ASSUMES:
#   The Exile alone; 904MAL_Kreia_Battle 0; G_PC_Align_Val above 50 (light:
#   R110, not c_dark's R113/R111; a_end_game's light branch).
#   904MAL_Atton_End 0: AttonEnd (k_attonend) does nothing in the game as
#   shipped (Atton's dying scene, 904atton, is cut content: nothing sets
#   the global).
#   Telos, Dantooine, Nar Shaddaa and Onderon each answer by their globals
#   (500OND_Civil_War, 602DAN_END, the Exchange's and Czerka's): every
#   branch leads to the next question asked here, so none is assumed.
#   The credits: TSL's ending calls no StartCreditSequence. a_playgoodmovie
#   queues MalMov11a, MalMov11b and MalMov12, whose last 326 s are
#   Credits.bik's roll; a_end_game's EndGame(FALSE) then goes to the main
#   menu (CClientExoAppInternal's end pending: the module unloaded, the
#   main menu shown). `credits` is met by the ending movie, then the end
#   (`Screen::rolls_credits`).
say There is much I must ask you. # start 3 (k_compatt): E96
say Why did you destroy Atris? # E81 to E84, then E89 or E85
say She never mentioned such feelings.
say I know. I... could not love her back.
say Why have you done this? # E74 to E78
say If you hate the Force, why do you use it? # E79, E80
say You were manipulating me all along. # E66, E68
say So you used me to get revenge on Sion and the others. # E69 to E73
say Why me? # E58, E59
say But there were other Jedi you could have chosen. # E61 to E65
say What happens now? # E56
say I will not fight you. # E57
say It's not too late, Kreia. I can save you, if you'll let me. # E47 to E53
say Malachor has not changed... only you have. # E54, E55
say This Academy here won't last, Kreia. # E92 to E95 (light: E93)
say If I had to, I would. You have to be stopped. # E43 to E46
say Then let us end this. # R47: a_atkonend, the fight
to CompAtt           # the Core's first bridge: k_compatt, 904Kreia
talk
say Yield, Kreia. You need not die. # start 2 at half her health: a hand
say I am Jedi, and I will not strike a defenseless opponent. # lost (light)
while 904MAL_Kreia_Battle=1
fight 60
end                  # (start 2 plays as she falls: a_kreia_fight)
say Kreia, there is still time to save you. # start 1, her second fall
say What happens now? # E209 to E212
say I will follow Revan, as I did a decade ago. # E214
say You spoke of the future. # E113 to E115
say What will happen to my friends? # E117 to E119
say Tell me of Mira.
say And Mandalore?
say What of the Mandalorians?
say And Visas? What of her?
say Did I save her?
say And the Handmaiden?
say The Handmaiden?
say But what about Atton?
say And you?
say Did you love me?
say And Bao-Dur - and the droids?
say And Revan? He came here, was here. What happened to him?
say Why?
say Why did you not follow him?
say I would see this future... the future of the galaxy.
say What of the Republic?
say The Sith have already struck against the Republic.
say But we've fought the Sith.
say Tell me of Dantooine.
say And Nar Shaddaa?
say What about Onderon?
say Tell me about Korriban.
say Rest now, Kreia. Your time in this place is over. # E108: her death,
while 904MAL_Kreia_Battle=2 # R110, E109 a_playgoodmovie, R112 a_end_game
fight 60             # Traya and the three lightsabers
end
credits              # MalMov11a, MalMov11b, MalMov12 (the credits),
                     # EndGame(FALSE): the main menu
